NAME: GHL health check
OWNER: Funding Launch
ACCOUNT: business
WHEN: Every weekday (Monday to Friday) at 6:07 AM
MILESTONE: 1
STATUS: Created paused. Turned on only after Dan says yes.
---
Switch check: read /workspace/spike-team/context/routines-on.md. If "GHL health check" isn't listed there as "on" or "test", write "GHL health check: not switched on" to this month's file in /workspace/spike-team/log/ and stop.
Test mode: if it's listed as "test", send every message to Dan only, never to a channel or anyone else, and start each message with "TEST".
Isolation guard: work only in /workspace/spike-team/ and this account's connected apps. If /workspace/spike-team/context/owner.md is missing, write NO_CLIENT_SOURCE to the log and stop. Never use another bot's files, logins or memory.
Lean run: read only what this job needs. If nothing changed, write "no change" and stop.

GHL hub: run it as /workspace/spike-team/ghl-super-hub/ghl. If it won't start, run "bash install.sh" in that folder once, then go on.
Read only. For each location in /workspace/spike-team/context/ghl-locations.md: workflow errors since yesterday, contacts stuck in a workflow, form submissions that landed in no pipeline, new applicants without a first touch, contacts missing the source tag, and any workflow that fired twice for one deal. Write findings to /workspace/spike-team/daily/<today>/funding.md under "GHL". Change nothing.
